    "source": "live",
    "probed_args": {
      "owner": "microsoft",
      "repo": "vscode",
      "sha": "a3b089bdf6dd50bf85586c39b01f345628b25dfa",
      "detail": "stats"
    },
    "_discriminator_note": "`detail` (enum none|stats|full_patch, default stats) is a confirmed shape discriminator: 'none' omits the top-level `stats` and `files` keys, and 'full_patch' adds `patch` to each files[] entry. All three values were probed. Resolved as a generic base model (SKILL step 4 option 2) rather than overloads: `detail` is an OPTIONAL param, and codegen emits a discriminator without a default, which would make it mandatory on every call. The keys that vary are dict/list, so none of them belong in `fields` \u2014 the base model is lossless here."
  },
